WEBVTT

NOTE
Accessibility audio description for Final Fantasy VIII - Disc 2 (Game Disc 3)
Scene: disc02_01h.avi - Rinoa drifting in space
Duration: approximately 27 seconds
For blind and low-vision players using screen readers

00:00.000 --> 00:27.000
Rinoa floats alone in the darkness of space, motionless and helpless. She wears a white spacesuit, her body limp and drifting. Her consciousness is uncertain — she appears unconscious or barely aware. Around her, debris from the destroyed Lunar Base tumbles slowly through the void. Fragments of metal, hull plating, and structural components drift at varying speeds and angles, some rotating, others falling straight. The camera pulls back gradually, making Rinoa smaller and smaller against the infinite black expanse of space. Stars surround her, glittering points of light in the darkness, emphasizing the profound isolation and vulnerability of her position. The scene is silent, haunting, and deeply melancholic — a lone human figure in the vast, empty cosmos, drifting without purpose or direction, abandoned in the void.
